  "aliases": [],
  "summary": "不用弹窗二次确认，按住删除按钮约 1 秒才生效：按住时按钮内一块颜色从左往右填满当进度，越接近完成抖得越厉害；填满的瞬间整行收拢消失。中途松手进度立刻归零，什么都不会发生。",
  "usage": "不可逆但单条的操作确认（删文件、清缓存、撤销发布）；触屏和鼠标都适用，每屏 1–10 个可删条目时最顺手。适合放进列表行内，不打断流程。",
  "caution": "不可逆且重要的操作（删账号、清空全部）仍要弹窗；进度扫满前一定要有可见的反馈，否则用户以为没反应；reduced-motion 下改成瞬时；阈值别低于 0.6 秒。",
  "hint": "按住垃圾桶图标约 1 秒才会删，中途松手归零；可点「恢复列表」重来",
  "inspiration": "",
  "prompt": "【长按渐进度删除】目标：删除这类不可逆操作不用弹窗二次确认，改成「按住按钮 1 秒」才算数——按住时按钮内一块颜色从左往右扫满作为进度，扫满即执行删除，中途松手进度立刻归零、什么也不发生。\n\n1) 结构：列表行 = 小图标 + 文件名/元信息（两行）+ 右侧「删除」按钮。删除按钮就是一个普通 button，宽高固定（卡片里 26px 高，弹窗里 38px），圆角 8–11px。\n\n2) 进度条实现（核心，来自视频）：\n   - `background-image: linear-gradient(90deg, 删除色 0 50%, transparent 50% 100%)`（硬停止，两段各占一半，不是渐变过渡）；\n   - `background-size: 200% 100%`；\n   - 常态 `background-position-x: 100%`（露出透明的那半，看到的是 background-color 的淡红底）；\n   - 按住时跑 `@keyframes fill { from{background-position-x:100%} to{background-position-x:0%} }`，`animation: fill 1s linear forwards`。\n   - 原理：背景图两倍宽，position 从 100% 挪到 0% 就是硬分界线从左边缘扫到右边缘，等于进度从 0 填到 100%；1 秒正好等于按住阈值。\n\n3) 交互：\n   - `pointerdown`：记录 active、加 `.holding` 类（触发动画）、`setTimeout` 1 秒后执行删除；\n   - `pointerup` / `pointercancel` 监听在 **window** 上（不是按钮上！）——按住后把指针拖出按钮再松开时，按钮自己收不到 pointerup，会永远卡在进度里；挂 window 才能保证任何地方松手都取消；\n   - 提前松手：`clearTimeout` + 移除 `.holding` 类，进度瞬间回零（再配合 `transition: background-position-x .12s linear` 会有一点回退感）；\n   - 到点：执行删除，行用 WAAPI 播 280ms 的「淡出 + 向右滑 28px + 高度收到 0」，onfinish 里 cancel 动画并 `display:none`；\n   - 不做 `click` 事件（长按根本不会触发 click），也不要在 pointerdown 里直接开始删除。\n\n4) 无障碍：键盘用「按住空格」等价（keydown Space 开始、keyup Space 取消、blur 取消，keydown 里判断 `e.repeat` 防止自动重复重开）；按钮 aria-label 写明「按住 1 秒删除 XX」。\n\n5) 手势细节：删除按钮加 `user-select:none` 和 `touch-action:none`，否则移动端长按会选中文字、或触发页面滚动把手势抢走；`contextmenu` 里 preventDefault，长按/右键不要弹系统菜单。\n\n6) 尺寸：卡片预览 3 行（`:nth-child(n+4){display:none}`）、行高约 32–38、按钮 26px；放大弹窗（`@media (min-height:421px)`）显示全部 9 行、行高 64、按钮 38px、字号 13.5。\n\n7) 配色：进度色和描边都用 var(--ui-danger) 的 `color-mix(..., transparent)`；按钮底 `color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-danger) 13%, transparent)`，文字用 var(--ui-text)（不要用白字，深色主题的按钮色很浅）；行底用 `color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-text) 4%, var(--ui-surface))`，避免浅色主题下和卡片背景同色不可分。\n\n8) 卡片自动演示：光标移到第一行删除按钮 → press 并保持 1 秒（进度走完、行消失）→ release → 1.1 秒后恢复列表 → 循环；全部逻辑走 `startHold()/cancelHold()/finish()` 这些业务函数，不要派发 pointerdown 事件。\n\n9) 降级与偏好：`prefers-reduced-motion:reduce` 下把进度动画改成瞬时完成（background-position-x 直接到 0%）、去掉按压缩放；阈值不要低于 0.6 秒否则又容易误触，也不要长于 1.5 秒否则用户会以为没反应。",
  "demoHtml": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml,body{height:100%}\nbody{margin:0;overflow:hidden;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",system-ui,\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;\n  color:var(--ui-text);background:var(--ui-bg);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:8px}\n\n.app{position:relative;width:100%;height:100%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;padding:8px;\n  border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;\n  background:var(--ui-bg);\n  background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 3%,var(--ui-bg));\n  border:1px solid var(--ui-border);\n  border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 14%,transparent)}\n\n.head{flex:0 0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\n  font-size:10.5px;font-weight:600;padding:0 3px 1px}\n.head .cnt{font-weight:400;font-size:9.5px;color:var(--ui-text-dim)}\n\n.list{flex:1 1 auto;min-height:0;list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;\n  display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;overflow:hidden}\n\n.row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;padding:3px 6px;max-height:46px;overflow:hidden;\n  border-radius:10px;\n  background:var(--ui-surface);\n  background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 4%,var(--ui-surface));\n  border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 8%,transparent)}\n.row:nth-child(n+4){display:none}\n\n.ico{width:15px;height:15px;flex:0 0 auto;display:block;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;\n  stroke-width:1.7;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;color:var(--ui-text-dim)}\n\n.meta{flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1px}\n.meta b{font-size:10.5px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.25;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}\n.meta i{font-size:8.5px;font-style:normal;line-height:1.25;color:var(--ui-text-dim);\n  white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}\n\n/* ===== 长按删除：默认只有一个灰色极简图标，按住才变红、进度从底部涨起 ===== */\n.del{flex:0 0 auto;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:6px;\n  border:0;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;\n  background-color:transparent;\n  /* 进度：底部一半是淡红，靠 background-position-y 从 0% 推到 100% 实现「涨水」 */\n  background-image:linear-gradient(to top,\n    color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-danger) 26%,transparent) 0 50%,\n    transparent 50% 100%);\n  background-size:100% 200%;\n  background-position-y:0%;\n  background-repeat:no-repeat;\n  color:var(--ui-text-dim);\n  transition:background-position-y .12s linear,color .2s ease,background-color .2s ease;\n  user-select:none;-webkit-user-select:none;touch-action:none;\n  position:relative;overflow:hidden}\n\n.del svg{width:17px;height:17px;display:block;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;\n  stroke-width:1.6;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}\n\n.del:hover{background-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 6%,transparent);color:var(--ui-text)}\n.del.holding{\n  animation:fill 1s linear forwards;\n  color:var(--ui-danger);\n  background-color:transparent;\n}\n@keyframes fill{\n  from{background-position-y:0%}\n  to{background-position-y:100%}\n}\n.del:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ui-danger);outline-offset:2px}\n\n.tools{position:absolute;left:10px;right:10px;bottom:8px;display:none;justify-content:flex-end}\n.tools button{height:26px;padding:0 12px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;font:inherit;\n  font-size:9.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ui-text);\n  border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 20%,transparent);\n  background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 6%,var(--ui-surface))}\n.tools button:hover{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 10%,var(--ui-surface))}\n\n/* ===== 放大弹窗 ===== */\n@media (min-height:421px){\n  .app{padding:18px 20px;gap:12px;border-radius:22px}\n  .head{font-size:16px;padding:0 4px 4px}\n  .head .cnt{font-size:13px}\n  .list{gap:8px}\n  .row{padding:6px 12px;max-height:58px;gap:11px;border-radius:14px}\n  .row:nth-child(n+4){display:flex}\n  .ico{width:21px;height:21px}\n  .meta b{font-size:15px}\n  .meta i{font-size:12px}\n  .del{padding:8px;border-radius:10px}\n  .del svg{width:21px;height:21px}\n  .tools{display:flex;left:20px;right:20px;bottom:14px}\n  .tools button{height:32px;padding:0 15px;font-size:12px;border-radius:10px}\n}\n@media (max-height:420px){\n  body{padding:6px}\n  .app{padding:7px;gap:5px}\n  .list{gap:4px}\n}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){\n  .del{transition:none}\n  .del.holding{animation:none;background-position-y:100%}\n}\n</style></head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"app\">\n  <div class=\"head\"><span>最近删除</span><span class=\"cnt\" id=\"cnt\">9 项</span></div>\n\n  <ul class=\"list\" id=\"list\">\n    <li class=\"row\">\n      <svg class=\"ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.5 3.5h7l4.5 4.5v12.5h-11.5z\"/><path d=\"M13.5 3.5v4.5h4.5\"/></svg>\n      <span class=\"meta\"><b>旧版设计稿.sketch</b><i>2.4 MB · 3 天前</i></span>\n      <button class=\"del\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"按住 1 秒删除旧版设计稿\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 7h16\"/><path d=\"M9.5 7V5.6a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 1.6-1.6h1.8a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 1.6 1.6V7\"/><path d=\"M6.6 7l.7 11.6A2 2 0 0 0 9.3 20.5h5.4a2 2 0 0 0 2-1.9L17.4 7\"/></svg></button>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"row\">\n      <svg class=\"ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.5 3.5h7l4.5 4.5v12.5h-11.5z\"/><path d=\"M13.5 3.5v4.5h4.5\"/></svg>\n      <span class=\"meta\"><b>首页草图 v2.png</b><i>860 KB · 昨天</i></span>\n      <button class=\"del\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"按住 1 秒删除首页草图\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 7h16\"/><path d=\"M9.5 7V5.6a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 1.6-1.6h1.8a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 1.6 1.6V7\"/><path d=\"M6.6 7l.7 11.6A2 2 0 0 0 9.3 20.5h5.4a2 2 0 0 0 2-1.9L17.4 7\"/></svg></button>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"row\">\n      <svg class=\"ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.5 3.5h7l4.5 4.5v12.5h-11.5z\"/><path d=\"M13.5 3.5v4.5h4.5\"/></svg>\n      <span class=\"meta\"><b>会议录屏.mov</b><i>128 MB · 5 天前</i></span>\n      <button class=\"del\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"按住 1 秒删除会议录屏\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 7h16\"/><path d=\"M9.5 7V5.6a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 1.6-1.6h1.8a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 1.6 1.6V7\"/><path d=\"M6.6 7l.7 11.6A2 2 0 0 0 9.3 20.5h5.4a2 2 0 0 0 2-1.9L17.4 7\"/></svg></button>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"row\">\n      <svg class=\"ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.5 3.5h7l4.5 4.5v12.5h-11.5z\"/><path d=\"M13.5 3.5v4.5h4.5\"/></svg>\n      <span class=\"meta\"><b>旧图标集.zip</b><i>4.1 MB · 上周</i></span>\n      <button class=\"del\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"按住 1 秒删除旧图标集\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 7h16\"/><path d=\"M9.5 7V5.6a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 1.6-1.6h1.8a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 1.6 1.6V7\"/><path d=\"M6.6 7l.7 11.6A2 2 0 0 0 9.3 20.5h5.4a2 2 0 0 0 2-1.9L17.4 7\"/></svg></button>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"row\">\n      <svg class=\"ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.5 3.5h7l4.5 4.5v12.5h-11.5z\"/><path d=\"M13.5 3.5v4.5h4.5\"/></svg>\n      <span class=\"meta\"><b>测试数据.csv</b><i>96 KB · 上周</i></span>\n      <button class=\"del\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"按住 1 秒删除测试数据\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 7h16\"/><path d=\"M9.5 7V5.6a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 1.6-1.6h1.8a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 1.6 1.6V7\"/><path d=\"M6.6 7l.7 11.6A2 2 0 0 0 9.3 20.5h5.4a2 2 0 0 0 2-1.9L17.4 7\"/></svg></button>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"row\">\n      <svg class=\"ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.5 3.5h7l4.5 4.5v12.5h-11.5z\"/><path d=\"M13.5 3.5v4.5h4.5\"/></svg>\n      <span class=\"meta\"><b>备份-0321</b><i>18 MB · 2 周前</i></span>\n      <button class=\"del\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"按住 1 秒删除备份\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 7h16\"/><path d=\"M9.5 7V5.6a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 1.6-1.6h1.8a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 1.6 1.6V7\"/><path d=\"M6.6 7l.7 11.6A2 2 0 0 0 9.3 20.5h5.4a2 2 0 0 0 2-1.9L17.4 7\"/></svg></button>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"row\">\n      <svg class=\"ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.5 3.5h7l4.5 4.5v12.5h-11.5z\"/><path d=\"M13.5 3.5v4.5h4.5\"/></svg>\n      <span class=\"meta\"><b>海报草稿.psd</b><i>42 MB · 2 周前</i></span>\n      <button class=\"del\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"按住 1 秒删除海报草稿\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 7h16\"/><path d=\"M9.5 7V5.6a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 1.6-1.6h1.8a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 1.6 1.6V7\"/><path d=\"M6.6 7l.7 11.6A2 2 0 0 0 9.3 20.5h5.4a2 2 0 0 0 2-1.9L17.4 7\"/></svg></button>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"row\">\n      <svg class=\"ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.5 3.5h7l4.5 4.5v12.5h-11.5z\"/><path d=\"M13.5 3.5v4.5h4.5\"/></svg>\n      <span class=\"meta\"><b>便签导出.md</b><i>12 KB · 3 周前</i></span>\n      <button class=\"del\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"按住 1 秒删除便签导出\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 7h16\"/><path d=\"M9.5 7V5.6a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 1.6-1.6h1.8a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 1.6 1.6V7\"/><path d=\"M6.6 7l.7 11.6A2 2 0 0 0 9.3 20.5h5.4a2 2 0 0 0 2-1.9L17.4 7\"/></svg></button>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"row\">\n      <svg class=\"ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.5 3.5h7l4.5 4.5v12.5h-11.5z\"/><path d=\"M13.5 3.5v4.5h4.5\"/></svg>\n      <span class=\"meta\"><b>临时笔记.txt</b><i>3 KB · 1 个月前</i></span>\n      <button class=\"del\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"按住 1 秒删除临时笔记\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 7h16\"/><path d=\"M9.5 7V5.6a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 1.6-1.6h1.8a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 1.6 1.6V7\"/><path d=\"M6.6 7l.7 11.6A2 2 0 0 0 9.3 20.5h5.4a2 2 0 0 0 2-1.9L17.4 7\"/></svg></button>\n    </li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <div class=\"tools\"><button type=\"button\" id=\"reset\">恢复列表</button></div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var list = document.getElementById('list'),\n      cnt = document.getElementById('cnt'),\n      reset = document.getElementById('reset');\n\n  var HOLD = 1000;                                  /* 阈值：按住 1 秒 */\n  var reduced = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\n  var listHTML = list.innerHTML;                    /* 用于「恢复列表」重建 */\n  var rows = [];\n\n  var active = null, timer = 0;\n  var shakeRaf = 0, shakeBtn = null, holdStart = 0;\n  var lastShuffle = 0, sx = 0, sy = 0, sr = 0;\n\n  /* ---------- 抖动：幅度极小（0.4→1.2px / 0.2→0.6°），每 50ms 换一次随机值 ---------- */\n  function startShake(btn){\n    stopShake();\n    if(reduced) return;\n    shakeBtn = btn;\n    holdStart = performance.now();\n    lastShuffle = 0;\n    (function loop(now){\n      var t = Math.min(1, (now - holdStart) / HOLD);\n      if(now - lastShuffle > 50){\n        var amp = 0.4 + 0.8 * t;\n        var rot = 0.2 + 0.4 * t;\n        sx = (Math.random() * 2 - 1) * amp;\n        sy = (Math.random() * 2 - 1) * amp;\n        sr = (Math.random() * 2 - 1) * rot;\n        lastShuffle = now;\n      }\n      btn.style.transform = 'translate(' + sx.toFixed(2) + 'px,' + sy.toFixed(2) +\n        'px) rotate(' + sr.toFixed(2) + 'deg)';\n      shakeRaf = requestAnimationFrame(loop);\n    })(performance.now());\n  }\n  function stopShake(){\n    if(shakeRaf) cancelAnimationFrame(shakeRaf);\n    shakeRaf = 0;\n    if(shakeBtn){ shakeBtn.style.transform = ''; shakeBtn = null; }\n  }\n\n  function setCount(){\n    var n = rows.filter(function(r){ return r.isConnected; }).length;\n    cnt.textContent = n + ' 项';\n  }\n\n  function startHold(row){\n    if(active) return;\n    active = row;\n    var btn = row.querySelector('.del');\n    btn.classList.add('holding');\n    startShake(btn);\n    timer = setTimeout(function(){ finish(row); }, HOLD);\n  }\n\n  function cancelHold(){\n    if(!active) return;\n    clearTimeout(timer);\n    timer = 0;\n    stopShake();\n    active.querySelector('.del').classList.remove('holding');\n    active = null;\n  }\n\n  /* 进度满 → 收拢和淡出用同一条曲线同时结束，onfinish 直接 remove()，不再有第二跳 */\n  function finish(row){\n    clearTimeout(timer);\n    timer = 0;\n    active = null;\n    stopShake();\n\n    var cs = getComputedStyle(row);\n    var h = row.getBoundingClientRect().height;\n    var gap = parseFloat(getComputedStyle(list).rowGap) || 0;\n    var pt = parseFloat(cs.paddingTop) || 0;\n    var pb = parseFloat(cs.paddingBottom) || 0;\n    var bw = parseFloat(cs.borderTopWidth) || 0;\n\n    row.style.overflow = 'hidden';\n    var a = row.animate(\n      [\n        {height: h + 'px', paddingTop: pt + 'px', paddingBottom: pb + 'px',\n         borderWidth: bw + 'px', marginBottom: '0px', opacity: 1},\n        {height: '0px', paddingTop: '0px', paddingBottom: '0px',\n         borderWidth: '0px', marginBottom: (-gap) + 'px', opacity: 0}\n      ],\n      {duration: 260, easing: 'cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1)', fill: 'forwards'}\n    );\n    a.onfinish = function(){\n      row.remove();\n      setCount();\n    };\n  }\n\n  function bindRows(){\n    rows = Array.prototype.slice.call(list.querySelectorAll('.row'));\n    rows.forEach(function(row){\n      var btn = row.querySelector('.del');\n\n      btn.addEventListener('pointerdown', function(e){\n        if(e.button !== undefined && e.button !== 0) return;\n        if(!row.isConnected) return;\n        if(btn.setPointerCapture) btn.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId);\n        startHold(row);\n      });\n\n      /* 键盘等价：按住空格确认 */\n      btn.addEventListener('keydown', function(e){\n        if(e.code !== 'Space') return;\n        e.preventDefault();\n        if(!e.repeat) startHold(row);\n      });\n      btn.addEventListener('keyup', function(e){\n        if(e.code !== 'Space') return;\n        e.preventDefault();\n        cancelHold();\n      });\n      btn.addEventListener('blur', function(){ cancelHold(); });\n\n      /* 长按不要弹出右键菜单 */\n      btn.addEventListener('contextmenu', function(e){ e.preventDefault(); });\n    });\n  }\n\n  /* 关键：收尾绑在 window 上。\n     按住后把指针移出按钮再松开，按钮自己收不到 pointerup，会一直卡在进度里 */\n  window.addEventListener('pointerup', cancelHold);\n  window.addEventListener('pointercancel', cancelHold);\n\n  function restoreAll(){\n    cancelHold();\n    stopShake();\n    list.innerHTML = listHTML;\n    bindRows();\n    setCount();\n  }\n  reset.addEventListener('click', restoreAll);\n\n  /* ===== 卡片预览自动演示：光标按住第一个垃圾桶 1 秒 → 行收拢消失 → 恢复 ===== */\n  var cursor = null, timers = [];\n  function later(fn, ms){ var id = setTimeout(fn, ms); timers.push(id); return id; }\n\n  function ensureCursor(){\n    if(cursor) return cursor;\n    if(window.__uiInteractive) return null;\n    if(typeof window.__uiDemoCursor === 'function') cursor = window.__uiDemoCursor();\n    return cursor;\n  }\n\n  function demo(){\n    if(window.__uiInteractive) return;\n    var c = ensureCursor();\n    if(!c) return;\n\n    if(!rows.length || !rows[0].isConnected) restoreAll();\n    var row = rows[0], btn = row.querySelector('.del');\n    var r = btn.getBoundingClientRect();\n    if(!r.width || !r.height){ later(demo, 300); return; }\n\n    c.el.classList.add('show');\n    c.moveTo(btn);\n    later(function(){\n      c.press();\n      startHold(row);\n      later(function(){\n        c.release();\n        later(function(){\n          restoreAll();\n          c.hide();\n          later(demo, 1400);\n        }, 1150);\n      }, 1040);\n    }, 560);\n  }\n\n  bindRows();\n  setCount();\n  if(!window.__uiInteractive) later(demo, 700);\n})();\n</script>\n</body></html>",
